      "updated": 1766655063445,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n1) Functional Requirements:  \n- User should be able to upload video\n- User should be able to stream video.\n\n---- Out of scope ------\n- searching for videos\n- comments and likes\n- making/following channels\n- recommended videos\n- pausing and starting video from some other points. how its done.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n1) Functional Requirements:  \n- User should be able to upload video\n- User should be able to stream video.\n\n---- Out of scope ------\n- searching for videos\n- comments and likes\n- making/following channels\n- recommended videos\n- pausing and starting video from some other points. how its done.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "b3QeLqnLHsxkexeN17H12",
