      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766655063445,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2) Non Functional Requirements (SPARCS):  \n- Scalability : 1M videos upload/day, 100M videos watched per day.\n- Low latency in terms of uploading & streaming video\n- resumable uploads\n- High availability\n- System should be able to upload and stream large videos(10s of GBs)\n\n------- Out of Scope --------\n- protection against bad content in videos\n- monitoring of fake accounts and everything.\n\n3) Core Entities \n- User\n- Video\n- VideoMetadata",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2) Non Functional Requirements (SPARCS):  \n- Scalability : 1M videos upload/day, 100M videos watched per day.\n- Low latency in terms of uploading & streaming video\n- resumable uploads\n- High availability\n- System should be able to upload and stream large videos(10s of GBs)\n\n------- Out of Scope --------\n- protection against bad content in videos\n- monitoring of fake accounts and everything.\n\n3) Core Entities \n- User\n- Video\n- VideoMetadata",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "A2P4AILlBEj0BXizHjARR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 740.9120592915714,
      "y": 738.103927965243,
      "width": 725.6259140844274,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
